abstract: >-
  CARTOGRAFFECT v3.0.0 proposes a formal theoretical architecture of affective experience grounded in
  active inference, separating strict instrumental controllability (Y) from autonomous arousal (A >= 0)
  under an L1 attentional budget, with canonical discretization Z in {0, 1, 2} (11 states), continuous
  depth Z in [0, 5], and 5 hardened empirical predictions (P1-P5). Formal internal consistency (V1) is
  verified in Lean 4.35.0 across 8 normative modules (148 substantial theorems / 169 exported
  declarations, 0 sorry) plus the canonical predictive engine extension (16+5=21 declarations) and 11
  Python unit tests. Empirical human validation (V3) remains pending (0 clinical or human dataset).
